# Ignore everything by default, then allowlist only what the image build needs.
#
# Docker/BuildKit checks COPY source paths against `.dockerignore` at the path
# level. Re-including only `dir/**` may include files under that directory but
# still leave the directory path itself (`dir`) treated as ignored.
# When the Dockerfile uses `COPY dir ...`, BuildKit can emit `CopyIgnoredFile`
# warnings even if the build succeeds.
#
# To avoid that, paths copied as directories are re-included twice:
# `!/dir` (directory entry) and `!/dir/**` (contents). The same applies to
# nested parents (for example `!/hack` and `!/hack/submodules`).

# Ignore everything.
**

# Include.
!/src
!/src/**
!/pyproject.toml
!/requirements*
!/LICENSE
!/COPYRIGHT
!/TRADEMARK

# Includes only used by ambox.
# Parent directories are explicitly re-included to avoid `CopyIgnoredFile`
# warnings for `COPY hack/...` paths in `hack/box/Dockerfile`.
!/hack
!/hack/box/**
!/hack/submodules
!/hack/submodules/archivematica-storage-service
!/hack/submodules/archivematica-storage-service/**
!/hack/submodules/archivematica-sampledata/SampleTransfers/DemoTransferCSV/**
!/hack/submodules/archivematica-sampledata/SampleTransfers/Images/**

# Exclude.
**/*~
**/*.log
**/node_modules
**/Thumbs.db
**/*.egg-info
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
